ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the safe or fast paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different antropomorphic characters and build relationships with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
